, "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303476_2630050647337413_6393422574423242231_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HbnztFN9AiIQ7kNvwGfSu7Z&_nc_oc=Ado0-ejrwhsPATFrgU_Tt4E8_Cbp6mcHEUM_Pp5o1DcIUCmVOF9bkoTKnxvnVfH7BVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xsCpIz102Q0B0wCfNfbR5lWMWnMwTDIZ-N7CtkoXYxA&oe=6A11AE82"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "667704452803486", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298254_667704456136819_1022445440440322231_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bf9CU57I-yMQ7kNvwGxogAv&_nc_oc=AdpJ99mBJk1Alr4puBRSEfMMOEF1tlvANDLjavWawhDn-O4F80QE47T7dljGdXhZ4no&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7a4DqFE6SUTfUu9OhcodQKFRs8ouG6xeASPCFOPFo90w&oe=6A11AA7C"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "2212265415867784", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_2212265419201117_5311145768653546432_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bi0HxIRRBbAQ7kNvwEeVc38&_nc_oc=Adr_TkmkBoU9mjYv9loCCSh6p5S2IPPPRd8cfv5_vjpJDJVc2TJrRXaEhO313mOUdXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af53w0HL_oEPYJjwey-nj2oOMVyTcbYmmM_quG4BxM-yoQ&oe=6A11AB41"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "687428147377431", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312039_687428150710764_498678448022996487_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdjfuuMrpUUQ7kNvwFTsIqH&_nc_oc=AdoQV5oJyLVf3ua9u2cZKSZy6KrYesvfJQWn5SMbofkFnThRLDXgevyjXlM27vCx6P8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5t8tLjZMl8jIUrNwCAv9GeDfBXphtzZwtdJTN0HzJODA&oe=6A119EA6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "App Lab Banner- Intulect  (1).png", "id": "1242180674168726", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307413_1242180677502059_8955428851085587533_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LGwTCf2ietMQ7kNvwFU444z&_nc_oc=AdrhMIeVa6iRthrMu_wjBMQxYgKROvzojpb_39ap01S03tP3R-QaA009-JMlKCnGoaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6GUSXuob570rxlaKs2EYMEPypbdaJ85FM1bI9LtBQ38A&oe=6A11B39A"}, "display_name": "Intulect", "keywords": ["Nursing", "Education", "Simulation", "Healthcare", "Medical"], "long_description": "Intulect\u2019s AI-powered VR Nursing Simulations provide scalable, immersive, and competency-based training for nursing students and hospital systems. Our platform leverages AI to moderate and assess clinical simulations, eliminating the need for live facilitators while ensuring realistic, high-quality training experiences.\n\nKey Features:\n- AI-Moderated Simulations \u2013 Nursing students engage with AI-driven patients and scenarios, allowing for self-guided, competency-based learning without requiring an instructor to be present.\n-Real-Time Performance Tracking \u2013 Automated grading and analytics provide educators with detailed insights into student decision-making and competency development.\n-Scalable Clinical Practice \u2013 Institutions can expand simulation access without increasing costs, making hands-on training more accessible to students.\n-High-Fidelity Patient Interactions \u2013 AI-driven patients respond dynamically, improving critical thinking, prioritization, and communication skills.\n-Seamless Integration \u2013 Designed to fit into nursing curricula, our simulations enhance theoretical learning, lab practice, and clinical training.\nWith Intulect, nursing programs and hospital systems can provide flexible, cost-effective, and data-driven training solutions, better preparing nurses for real-world challenges.", "short_description": "Where Training Becomes Instinct. Intulect is an AI-Facilitated Nursing Simulation Platform to improve clinical preparedness for all level of learners in healthcare. "}]}, "developer_name": "Intulect", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://intulect.com/policies/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_u